-teal-200">Threat Matrix<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only"> (external site)</span></a></li></ul></nav></div></header><main id="content" class="flex-1"><div class="min-h-screen bg-[#06070a] rg-page"><article class="max-w-5xl w-full mx-auto px-6 py-12"><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-white">Reports</h1><p class="text-gray-300 mb-8">All OpenA2A research reports, newest first. The research tracks follow the list.</p><section class="mb-12"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-white">All published</h2><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4"><a class="text-teal-300 hover:underline font-semibold" href="/reports/state-of-ai-agent-security-2026-10">State of AI Agent Security: The Tool Calls Arrive</a><div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1"><time dateTime="2026-10-19">October 2026</time></div></li><li class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4"><a class="text-teal-300 hover:underline font-semibold" href="/reports/state-of-ai-agent-security-2026-09">State of AI Agent Security: Volume Without Declared Agents</a><div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1"><time dateTime="2026-09-17">September 2026</time></div></li><li class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4"><a class="text-teal-300 hover:underline font-semibold" href="/reports/state-of-ai-agent-security-2026-08">State of AI Agent Security: The Identity Ceiling</a><div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1"><time dateTime="2026-08-16">August 2026</time></div></li><li class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4"><a class="text-teal-300 hover:underline font-semibold" href="/reports/state-of-ai-agent-security-2026-07">State of AI Agent Security: Who Follows the Bait</a><div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1"><time dateTime="2026-07-22">July 2026</time></div></li><li class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4"><a class="text-teal-300 hover:underline font-semibold" href="/reports/state-of-ai-agent-security-2026-06">State of AI Agent Security: A Surface in Migration</a><div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1"><time dateTime="2026-06-15">June 2026</time></div></li><li class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4"><a class="text-teal-300 hover:underline font-semibold" href="/reports/state-of-ai-agent-security-2026-05">State of AI Agent Security: The Protocol Attackers Prefer</a><div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1"><time dateTime="2026-05-12">May 2026</time></div></li><li class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4"><a class="text-teal-300 hover:underline font-semibold" href="/reports/april-2026-exposure-sweep">Internet-Wide AI Exposure Sweep: April 2026</a><div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1"><time dateTime="2026-04-10">April 2026</time></div></li><li class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4"><a class="text-teal-300 hover:underline font-semibold" href="/reports/oasb-scanner-benchmark-april-2026">OASB scanner benchmark, April 2026</a><div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1"><time dateTime="2026-04-02">April 2026</time> · Withdrawn</div></li><li class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4"><a class="text-teal-300 hover:underline font-semibold" href="/reports/march-2026-exposure-sweep">Internet-Wide AI Exposure Sweep: March 2026</a><div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1"><time dateTime="2026-03-20">March 2026</time></div></li><li class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4"><a class="text-teal-300 hover:underline font-semibold" href="/reports/state-of-ai-agent-security">AI agent security: 97,000 hosts, 1,190 exposed configs</a><div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1"><time dateTime="2026-02-05">February 2026</time></div></li></ul></section><section class="mb-12"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-white">Tracks</h2><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><a class="block bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-teal-500/60 transition-colors" href="/reports/exposure-sweeps"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1"><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">Exposure sweeps</h3><span class="text-xs text-gray-400">Monthly</span></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mb-2">Infrastructure census via Shodan methodology. Population-level exposure measurement.</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-400">2 published</p></a><a class="block bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-teal-500/60 transition-colors" href="/reports/behavioral"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1"><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">Behavioral Threat Reports</h3><span class="text-xs text-gray-400">Monthly</span></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mb-2">Honeypot fleet observations classified by Threat Matrix technique. Cross-property attribution.</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-400">6 published</p></a><a class="block bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-teal-500/60 transition-colors" href="/reports/disclosures"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1"><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">Coordinated disclosures</h3><span class="text-xs text-gray-400">Event-driven</span></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mb-2">CVE pipeline publications. Follows the established 90-day disclosure protocol.</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Archive empty. First report pending.</p></a><a class="block bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-teal-500/60 transition-colors" href="/reports/foitw"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1"><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">First Observed In The Wild</h3><span class="text-xs text-gray-400">Event-driven</span></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mb-2">Same-week posts when a pre-registered technique signature first fires.</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Archive empty. First report pending.</p></a><a class="block bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-teal-500/60 transition-colors" href="/indices"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1"><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">Indices</h3><span class="text-xs text-gray-400">Live</span></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mb-2">Three live pages: Exposure Prevalence, Attack Prevalence, Sophistication.</p></a><a class="block bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-teal-500/60 transition-colors" href="/reports/state-of-ai-agent-security"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1"><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">Annual report</h3><span class="text-xs text-gray-400">Yearly</span></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mb-2">Full-year consolidation across all tracks.</p></a></div></section></article></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="border-t border-white/10" style="background:#06070a"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-10 sm:px-6"><nav aria-label="Footer" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3"><div><p class="text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em]" style="font-family:var(--font-plex-mono), monospace;color:#5fd0c6">Research</p><ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm"><li><a class="text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/">Research home</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/reports">Reports</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/reports/disclosures">Coordinated disclosures</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/indices">Indices</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/methodology">Methodology</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/about">About</a></li><li><a hr